name: Marked scope boundaries, exact six-job approval and per-scope recurrence
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-scopes
keys: Space Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 2 boundaries marked | marked-boundaries
ask: Can the operator mark only the intended discovery boundaries while shared context and unplanned siblings remain distinguishable?
keys: p
require-live-snap: 30 PLAN A STUDY | scope-study
keys: Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 CHOOSE DISCOVERY ENGINES | engine-choice
keys: m
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 [x] agentic | selected-agentic
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Engine choices updated | selected-engine
keys: Down
require-live-snap: 20 Selected boundaries: 2 | selected-workload
expect: 6 fixed discovery jobs
keys: Down Enter
type: 8
keys: Enter Down Enter
type: 2
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 30 Scope draft ready | frozen-plan
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART draft
keys: L End
require-live-snap: 30 y approve | exact-approval
expect: 6 fixed jobs
expect: Total provider calls: 8
expect: Protected review calls: 2
ask: Does approval show all six finite jobs and the shared allowance before any request, without approving sibling or follow-up work?
keys: y
require-live-snap: 30 Approval saved | approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 30 dispatcher pid | running
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART completed
keys: r
require-live-snap: 30 6 completed | completed
keys: Escape
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 30 RESULT READY | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
keys: Escape
paste-file: @ART/open-app.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Labeled app observation | app-finding
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned workflow fixture; no defect claimed
require-live-snap: 30 rejected_false_positive | app-decision
paste-file: @ART/open-other.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 30 Labeled other observation | other-finding
submit: dismiss false_positive Owned workflow fixture; no defect claimed
require-live-snap: 30 rejected_false_positive | other-decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope study: | scope-report
expect: 6 committed / 8 calls
expect: 2 protected review remaining
expect: 3 completed / 3 planned
expect: Unplanned boundaries: integration
ask: Does the report retain separate three-pass scope denominators, shared spending and the unplanned boundary, with no complete coverage claim?
keys: p
resize: 160x48
live-snap: report-160x48
resize: 96x89
live-snap: report-96x89
resize: 80x24
live-snap: report-80x24
resize: 60x20
live-snap: report-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: report-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-1-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-2-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-3-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-4-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-5-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-6-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-7-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-8-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-9-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-10-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-11-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-12-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-13-40x12
keys: NPage
live-snap: report-page-14-40x12
ask: At 40x12, can the operator page through scope, spending and context evidence without hidden actions or overlapping controls?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1 KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1
resize: 80x24
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 30 Scope study: | recovered-report
expect: 6 committed / 8 calls
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/finite_scopes.py @TMP_TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does restart preserve the selected scope study, decisions, fixed workload and accounting without starting another model request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
